      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T07:02:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The current scope is limited to populating OEM metadata for the requested extension when the event does not already provide that extension. To keep the design simple, runtime enrichment is currently based on the user-configured interface only.\n\nSupporting multiple extension types or interface overloading would require additional framework behavior and conflict handling. We can address that as a follow-up if there is a concrete use case.",
